OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe M6 wrong way driving
OL,4,Aincidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating reports of
OL,7,Fseveral drivers travelling in the wrong
OL,8,Fdirection on an M6 slip road, in order
OL,9,Fto avoid delays following a crash on
OL,10,Fthe motorway.
OL,12,FA Lancashire Police spokesperson said
OL,13,Fthey had received a report of a crash
OL,14,Fnear junction 34 of the M6 in Lancaster
OL,15,Fon Sunday afternoon, and were told
OL,16,Fseveral drivers had subsequently gone
OL,17,Fthe wrong way back up the slip road to
OL,18,Favoid being caught in queues.
OL,20,FThankfully nobody was seriously hurt,
OL,21,Fbut police said drivers' actions could
OL,22,Fhave had "devastating consequences".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
