OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe M6 wrong way driving
OL,4,Aincidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe warning comes days after a car
OL,7,Ftravelling the wrong way on the A66 in
OL,8,FTeesside crashed into a police vehicle,
OL,9,Fkilling seven people, including the two
OL,10,Fofficers.
